## Purpose and reviewed scope

The frozen pre-consolidation inventory contains **908 branch names and 892 distinct tips**. This PR combines the selected current implementation and its original controls, records **296 terminal dispositions covering all 908 names**, and preserves the original history before branch cleanup.

The selected runtime includes ownership and lifecycle boundaries, fresh Host observation, receiver scheduling, worker accounting, native statement and mining-time controls, and the explicitly retained Cell, network and recovery APIs. Conflicting historical alternatives retain explicit dispositions; archiving an alternative is not a claim that its behavior is implemented by the current runtime.

The [audit report]({url}/blob/{head}/docs/development/BRANCH_CONSOLIDATION_AUDIT_20261114.md), [original audit evidence index]({url}/blob/{head}/evidence/branch-consolidation-20261114/ARTIFACT_INDEX.json) and [later execution records]({execution_evidence_url}) distinguish source review, component observations, exact full-lane results and unresolved qualification. Current-source binding and fixture repairs retain their original acceptance limits and historical evidence.

